<div class="span9 about-main-image">
<div class="span6 about-description"><h1 class="sr-only"><span data-teams="true">New Utrecht Library and Affordable Housing RFP</span></h1>
<p><a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/new-utrecht-library-rfp.page">Return to homepage</a></p>
<div>
<div class="row">
<div class="span3"><a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/new-utrecht-library-rfp-site-overview.page" class="button-link btn-standard-hpd btn-standard-hpd-mod">Site<br />Overview</a></div>
<div class="span3"><a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/new-utrecht-library-rfp-how-to-get-involved.page" class="button-link btn-standard-hpd btn-standard-hpd-mod">How to Get<br />Involved</a></div>
<div class="span3"><a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/new-utrecht-library-rfp-process-faqs.page" class="button-link btn-standard-hpd btn-standard-hpd-mod">RFP Process and FAQ</a></div>
<div class="span3"><a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/new-utrecht-library-rfp-submit-response.page" class="button-link btn-standard-hpd btn-standard-hpd-mod">Submit an RFP<br />Response</a></div>
</div>
<hr />
<h2><strong><span data-contrast="auto">RFP Release</span></strong><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p>HPD&nbsp;released&nbsp;the New Utrecht Library and Affordable Housing Request for Proposals (RFP) on&nbsp;<strong>June 10, 2026</strong>.&nbsp;HPD and BPL invite developers to&nbsp;submit&nbsp;proposals for the redevelopment of New Utrecht Library in Brooklyn with a new&nbsp;state-of-the-art&nbsp;library alongside 100 percent affordable housing.&nbsp; An online pre-submission conference was held on <strong>Wednesday, July 1, 2026.</strong> Submissions were due on <strong>September 4, 2026.</strong></p>
<h2>RFP Documents</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/zip/new-utrecht-library-rfp.zip"><span data-contrast="auto">New Utrecht Library RFP and Required Forms&nbsp;</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/pdfs/services/new-utrecht-rfp-pre-submission-conference-07012026.pdf"><span data-contrast="auto">Pre-Submission Conference presentation slides</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/pdfs/services/new-utrecht-library-rfp-addendum-1.pdf">New Utrecht Library RFP Addendum 1&nbsp;</a></li>
<li><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/pdfs/services/new-utrecht-library-rfp-addendum-2.pdf">New Utrecht Library RFP Addendum 2&nbsp;</a></li>
<li><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/pdfs/services/new-utrecht-library-rfp-addendum-3.pdf">New Utrecht Library RFP Addendum 3&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<h2><span data-ccp-props="{}">Inquiries </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">All communications must be made in writingto</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><a href="mailto:NewUtrechtLibrary@hpd.nyc.gov"><strong><span data-contrast="none">NewUtrechtLibrary@hpd.nyc.gov.</span></strong></a></p>
</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
